@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:哇……好大。|#0101Adv04_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:原来，<br>关押着艾玛她们的牢房位于地下。|#0101Adv04_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:登上长长的楼梯，迎面而来的是<br>充满豪华洋宅气息的，宽阔的玄关大厅。|#0101Adv04_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:长长的过道望不见尽头，过道上的门也数不清到底有几扇。<br>连结上层的大楼梯十分地长，脖子往上扭得生疼才能望到顶。|#0101Adv04_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:建筑物内许多地方都相当地破旧，营造出<br>令人汗毛直竖的气氛。总而言之，这里大得出奇。|#0101Adv04_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@ModifyBackgroundExtended DissolveTexturePath:VerticalBlindGradually TintColor:#000000 Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor.Custom SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.5

