@ModifyBackgroundExtended DissolveTexturePath:VerticalBlindGradually TintColor:#000000 Duration:0.99 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent.Custom SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:0.9

[PrintTextModified Text:看守进入了附近的房间内，<br>艾玛也跟着走了进去。|#0101Adv04_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这里应该就是会客厅了。|#0101Adv04_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:和冷冰冰的，充满压迫感的地下不同，<br>这里是个气派华丽，却透着一股邪气的空间。|#0101Adv04_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:高高的天花板悬挂着吊灯，<br>地上铺着一层老旧的绒毯。房内还配备着沙发和暖炉。|#0101Adv04_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:装饰在室内的物品相当恶趣味。<br>其中，有样东西吸住了艾玛的眼球——|#0101Adv04_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Fearful1

[PrintTextModified Text:这东西，是真的……？|#0101Adv04_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ResetText
@ModifyCamera Offset:8,0 Zoom:0.6 EasingTypeName:SmoothStep Duration:0.9 Lazy:false
@Wait WaitMode:0.9

[PrintTextModified Text:墙上挂着一把巨大的弩枪。<br>夸张的尺寸侵占着视野，令艾玛脊背发凉。|#0101Adv04_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@ModifyCamera Offset:0,0 Zoom:0 EasingTypeName:SmoothStep Duration:0.9 Lazy:false
@Wait WaitMode:0.9

[PrintTextModified Text:门外站着一位黑衣看守，<br>正把守连结过道的出入口。|#0101Adv04_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:既然入口已被封锁，<br>看样子，所有人都已经到齐了。|#0101Adv04_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
