[PrintTextModified Text:她身材高挑，<br>透出一股宛如骑士一般的飒爽英气。|#0101Adv04_Narrative031| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:正所谓锦上添花，<br>她的腰间还佩了一把刺剑，更衬托她的风采。|#0101Adv04_Narrative032| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她的超凡气质似乎震撼了大家，<br>每个人都不禁屏住呼吸，目不转睛地看着她。|#0101Adv04_Narrative033| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

