[PrintTextModified Text:能先让我讲话吗？<br>你的名字叫蕾雅对不对。<br>一上来就笑话别人，也太失礼了吧？|#0101Adv04_Hanna002| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:呃，抱歉。我没想到你这么介意。<br>求你大人有大量，原谅我吧。|#0101Adv04_Leia002| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Flushed1,ArmL1

