[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛低头看着自己的膝盖，<br>才发现上面正流着血。|#0101Adv04_Narrative039| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（是刚刚被希罗推倒的时候受的伤……）|#0101Adv04_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不算什么问题啦，没事的！|#0101Adv04_Ema008| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这，当然有问题了……|#0101Adv04_Meruru004| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default
@AnimateActorExtended ActorIds:Meruru Loop:false ScenePositionY:30 Duration:1.2

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露露出一副差点要哭出来的表情。<br>接着，她单膝跪地，把手放在了艾玛的膝盖上面。|#0101Adv04_Narrative040| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——然后，接下来发生的事情令艾玛吃了一惊。|#0101Adv04_Narrative041| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:欸……？|#0101Adv04_Ema009| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露的掌心发出光芒，<br>而艾玛膝上的伤口正肉眼可见地愈合。|#0101Adv04_Narrative042| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:在场所有人直到上一刻还在互相打量提防着他人，<br>下一刻就都把目光齐刷刷聚集在了她展现出的神奇力量上。|#0101Adv04_Narrative043| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@AnimateActorExtended ActorIds:Meruru Loop:false ScenePositionY:50 Duration:1.2
[PrintTextModified Text:你痛不痛？没事吧？|#0101Adv04_Meruru005| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:谢、谢谢你。|#0101Adv04_Ema010| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Duration:1.2 Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露讲话时扭捏地望着地面，<br>并没有对上艾玛的眼睛。|#0101Adv04_Narrative044| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Normal1,ArmR9

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅清了清嗓子，准备重新回到刚才的话题。|#0101Adv04_Narrative045| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……虽然很想问这道神奇力量是什么情况，<br>但是其他人还没介绍完，<br>我觉得还是先继续自我介绍吧。下一个。你可以自我介绍下吗？|#0101Adv04_Leia006| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

