@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:不好意思，好像就剩你还没自我介绍了。<br>能告诉我你的名字吗？|#0101Adv04_Leia013| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

