[PrintTextModified Text:希罗似乎抱持有绝对的自信，<br>声音中没有一丝迷惘。紧接着——|#0101Adv04_Narrative066| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Angry1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:给这个国家带来灾难的危险因子，<br>是她才对。|#0101Adv04_Hiro003| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:唰——她伸出手指着艾玛。|#0101Adv04_Narrative067| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

