@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:60 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露靠在艾玛身旁，手掌轻轻扶住她的手臂。<br>虽然没有直视着她，但梅露露的担心应该是发自真心的。|#0101Adv04_Narrative068| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛小姐……|#0101Adv04_Meruru006| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:40 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:面对梅露露的暖心举动，艾玛露出了微笑。|#0101Adv04_Narrative069| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆強がりなので少し震え声で

[PrintTextModified Text:欸嘿嘿，没事的啦。|#0101Adv04_Ema018| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Warden.1

[PrintTextModified Text:对于希罗的指控，<br>典狱长叹了口气，打心底里觉得麻烦。|#0101Adv04_Narrative070| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:唉～～……我说，求你们了。请接受你们是恶人的事实。<br>我很不想加班啦，<br>希望大家能和和气气开开心心地相处下去……|#0101Adv04_Warden018| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Rotation:,,0 Scale:"{g_backgroundDefaultScale * 2}" Duration:0.6 Lazy:false ScenePosition:30,60 AppearanceAndTransition:5_1 SubId:Middle
@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:1.2 Duration:0.9 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,40 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Angry1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:你错了。我不是邪恶。|#0101Adv04_Hiro004| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:希罗毫不犹豫地向前走出一步。|#0101Adv04_Narrative071| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@AnimateActorExtended ActorIds:Hiro-Middle Loop:false ScenePositionY:35 Scale:1.3

[PrintTextModified Text:能导正这个世界的，只有我。|#0101Adv04_Hiro005| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@AnimateActorExtended ActorIds:Hiro-Middle Loop:false ScenePositionY:30 Scale:1.4

[PrintTextModified Text:就让我来消灭这个世界的邪恶。<br>第一个该消灭的——|#0101Adv04_Hiro006| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@AnimateActorExtended ActorIds:Hiro-Middle Loop:false ScenePositionY:30 Scale:1.4

[PrintTextModified Text:希罗将倚靠在暖炉旁的<br>拨火棍拿到手里。|#0101Adv04_Narrative072| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她那浑浊的双眼紧盯着艾玛。<br>艾玛害怕极了，不由得往后退。|#0101Adv04_Narrative073| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@AnimateActorExtended ActorIds:MainBackground-Middle Loop:false ScenePositionY:86 EasingTypeName:EaseOutQuad Duration:0.6
@AnimateActorExtended ActorIds:Hiro-Middle Loop:false ScenePositionY:70 EasingTypeName:EaseOutQuad Duration:0.6

[PrintTextModified Text:"（不可能，的吧……？<br>　再怎么讨厌我，也不至于要杀人吧）|#0101Adv04_Ema019|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:希罗手持凶器，<br>令少女之间的气氛愈发紧张。|#0101Adv04_Narrative074| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@AnimateActorExtended ActorIds:MainBackground-Middle Loop:false ScenePositionY:56 EasingTypeName:EaseOutQuad Duration:0.6
@AnimateActorExtended ActorIds:Hiro-Middle Loop:false ScenePositionY:80 Scale:1.5 Duration:0.9

[PrintTextModified Text:就是你！怪物！|#0101Adv04_Hiro007| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——哒。希罗凌空一跃。|#0101Adv04_Narrative075| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

