@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_10 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:10_2

[PrintTextModified Text:希罗无数次挥动手中的拨火棍。|#0101Adv04_Narrative081| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_10 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:血肉飞溅，<br>将她的脸庞染得越来越红。|#0101Adv04_Narrative082| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_10 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:在她无情的攻击下，看守的身体毁坏得失去了原形。<br>如果是一般的人类，挨上一下或许便一命呜呼了。|#0101Adv04_Narrative083| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_10 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:而希罗却不带半点犹豫，<br>要将看守彻底击溃。|#0101Adv04_Narrative084| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:10_3

[PrintTextModified Text:在场的所有人只能在旁目睹<br>这幅惨烈的景象。|#0101Adv04_Narrative085| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:尽管手中快速挥舞着沉重的拨火棍，<br>她仍能作出敏捷的机动动作。|#0101Adv04_Narrative086| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:10_4

[PrintTextModified Text:——即便如此。|#0101Adv04_Narrative087| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

