[PrintTextModified Text:摇摇晃晃地彷徨了数秒后，<br>“咚”地一下倒在地面上。|#0101Adv04_Narrative093| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Fearful1,ArmR4

[PrintTextModified Text:呀啊啊啊——！！|#0101Adv04_Hanna006| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:刚刚斩落的头颅睁大着眼睛，<br>露出了惊讶的表情。|#0101Adv04_Narrative094| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:而向艾玛投去嫌恶眼神的双眼，<br>已经失去了光芒。|#0101Adv04_Narrative095| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Fearful1,ArmR3,ArmL7

[PrintTextModified Text:希罗……？|#0101Adv04_Ema022| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（明明想着还可以重来……还可以再和你当朋友的）|#0101Adv04_Ema023| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:二阶堂希罗，死了。|#0101Adv04_Narrative096| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛茫然地，颤抖着靠近<br>希罗的头颅，伸出了手。|#0101Adv04_Narrative097| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她的手，触碰着沾满鲜血的面庞。|#0101Adv04_Narrative098| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Cry1,ArmR5,ArmL7

[PrintTextModified Text:这不是真的吧，希罗……？<br>不要，不要，不要。|#0101Adv04_Ema024| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛的眼中逐渐溢出泪水，<br>一颗颗从她脸上滑落。|#0101Adv04_Narrative099| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她发现，在视野的一角，残余遗体的近处，<br>有一样闪闪发光的东西。|#0101Adv04_Narrative100| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那似乎是随着希罗身体倒下，<br>从她的口袋中掉出来的。|#0101Adv04_Narrative101| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛马上把那件<br>伸手可及的物品捡了起来。|#0101Adv04_Narrative102| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; 証拠品：『ヒロの万年筆』入手
; ========================================

[PrintTextModified Text:（这是……）|#0101Adv04_Ema025| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:握在艾玛手中的<br>是一支钢笔。|#0101Adv04_Narrative103| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这支钢笔对艾玛来说，也是一件十分重要的物品——|#0101Adv04_Narrative104| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Cry1,ArmR3,ArmL7

[PrintTextModified Text:（希罗……我不会再把它弄丢了）|#0101Adv04_Ema026| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛将钢笔收进了自己的口袋里。|#0101Adv04_Narrative105| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; [char ゴクチョー.差分なしCenter,]
; ========================================

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Warden.1

[PrintTextModified Text:哇～……死掉了呢……<br>还得打扫……|#0101Adv04_Warden019| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，不过，魔女是不会因为这样的事死掉的，<br>所以这证明了她不是魔女呢。|#0101Adv04_Warden020| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:哎呀呀……真是太好了。|#0101Adv04_Warden021| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Cry1,ArmR3,ArmL7

[PrintTextModified Text:"（好……？<br>　希罗都死了，怎么可能好……！）|#0101Adv04_Ema027|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛擦去眼泪，<br>紧紧瞪住了典狱长。|#0101Adv04_Narrative106| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Determined2,ArmR3,ArmL7

[PrintTextModified Text:但典狱长并不介意她的眼神，<br>只是以严肃的语气往下说道。|#0101Adv04_Narrative107| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Warden.1

[PrintTextModified Text:——啊，还有几句话要说，真是不好意思。<br>有一件最重要的事情，<br>要跟大家说清楚。|#0101Adv04_Warden022| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:即将转变为魔女的人，<br>会产生无法抑制的杀意或妄想。|#0101Adv04_Warden023| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这就会带来一桩麻烦事……<br>总有一天囚犯内部会发生凶杀案。|#0101Adv04_Warden024| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1,ArmR1,ArmL1,Pale-Off,Sweat-Off,Cheeks-Normal,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Sparkle_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open

[PrintTextModified Text:凶杀案！？|#0101Adv04_Sherry010| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:听到这番话后，雪莉的眼睛闪着<br>不合时宜的亮光。|#0101Adv04_Narrative108| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Warden.1

[PrintTextModified Text:是啊……每次都会有这种事……<br>再怎么说也不可能和危险人物共同生活，对不对。|#0101Adv04_Warden025| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:所以呢，只要发生了凶杀案，<br>我们就会举行【魔女审判】。|#0101Adv04_Warden026| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:成为【魔女】的囚犯呢……嗯……<br>……我们会对其处以死刑……|#0101Adv04_Warden027| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:详细情况麻烦去看【魔女图鉴】。<br>我就失陪啦……|#0101Adv04_Warden028| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

